pico-minicpm5
Copyright 2026 PicoNPU Enablement Contributors

This product includes software developed for the PicoNPU / SVP_NNN compiler
enablement project.

MiniCPM5-1B is developed by OpenBMB and is obtained separately from
https://huggingface.co/openbmb/MiniCPM5-1B. No model weights are included in
the source distribution.

ATC, DDK, libinstsim and `libsvp_custom.so` are external user-supplied
components and are not distributed by this project.

The four AArch64 objects in `app/lib/` (`libsvp_acl.so`, `libsvp_aicpu.so`,
`libprotobuf-c.so.1`, `libsecurec.so`) are the SS928V100_SDK_V2.0.2.2 SVP ACL
runtime required by the board executor. They ship with the board application
so a factory Euler Pi image can load OMs without a second SDK checkout.
